rosprofiler.ico is a composition of three Microsoft Fluent Emoji 3D
artworks ((C) Microsoft Corporation, MIT license,
https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji):

  - assets/Desktop computer/3D/desktop_computer_3d.png (base)
  - assets/Chart increasing/3D/chart_increasing_3d.png (fitted to the
    monitor's screen area)
  - assets/Magnifying glass tilted left/3D/magnifying_glass_tilted_left_3d.png
    (overlaid lower right)

The composition was rescaled into the multi-resolution Windows icon
frames.  The MIT license text follows.

